<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>战争</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: "PingFang SC", "Microsoft YaHei", sans-serif;
            margin: 20px;
            color: #333;
            background-color: #fff;
        }
        h1 {
            font-size: 32px;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            font-weight: bold;
        }
        .table-container {
            position: relative;
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 1000px;
        }
        table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            table-layout: fixed;
        }
        th, td {
            padding: 12px 15px;
            border: 2px solid #fff;
            vertical-align: top;
            line-height: 1.6;
            font-size: 14px;
        }
        th {
            background-color: #5b82d6;
            color: white;
            text-align: left;
            font-weight: bold;
        }
        /* Column widths */
        th:nth-child(1), td:nth-child(1) {
            width: 15%;
        }
        th:nth-child(2), td:nth-child(2) {
            width: 30%;
        }
        th:nth-child(3), td:nth-child(3) {
            width: 55%;
        }

        /* Alternating row colors */
        tr:nth-child(even) td {
            background-color: #dbe2f0;
        }
        tr:nth-child(odd) td {
            background-color: #eef2f7;
        }

        .red-text {
            color: #c00000;
        }
        .bold-text {
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        .watermark {
            position: absolute;
            bottom: 20px;
            right: 20px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            pointer-events: none;
        }
        .watermark svg {
            width: 40px;
            height: 40px;
            fill: white;
            opacity: 0.9;
            margin-right: 10px;
            filter: drop-shadow(1px 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.2));
        }
        .watermark-text {
            color: white;
            opacity: 0.9;
            text-shadow: 1px 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
        }
        .watermark-text .title {
            font-size: 18px;
            font-weight: bold;
        }
        .watermark-text .subtitle {
            font-size: 14px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <h1>战争</h1>

    <div class="table-container">
        <table>
            <tr>
                <th>时间</th>
                <th>战争</th>
                <th>考点</th>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td><span class="red-text">1066开始</span></td>
                <td>诺曼征服 The Norman Conquest</td>
                <td>1.William the Conqueror (William I)威廉一世(征服者)，<br>2.两种语言Anglo-Saxon 和Norman语<br>3. 1086年The Domesday Book末日书威廉一世搞的土地调查记录</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>1066年</td>
                <td>黑斯廷斯之战Battle of Hastings</td>
                <td>Bayeux tapestry《贝叶挂毯》记录了该战争。</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>1314</td>
                <td>班诺克本战役 Bannockburn</td>
                <td>1.the Scottish king Robert the Bruce第一次苏格兰独立战争<br>2.来自苏格兰的君主：king Robert the Bruce罗伯特<br>3.来自荷兰的君主：查理二世（就是流亡那个）</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>1337至1453</td>
                <td>英法百年战争Hundred Years War</td>
                <td>英、法两国百余年间断续进行的战争</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>1455-1485</td>
                <td>玫瑰之战Wars of Roses</td>
                <td>约克和兰卡斯特家族对战</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td><span class="red-text bold-text">1588这个时间<br>考</span></td>
                <td>英国海军 打败西班牙无敌舰队<br>伊丽莎白一世</td>
                <td>the English defeated the Spanish Armada打败西班牙无敌舰队，<br>标志着日不落帝国的崛起。</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>1642-1646<br>查理一世</td>
                <td>英国内战 Civil War 第一次</td>
                <td>1.保皇派和国会的斗争<br>2.保皇派=the Cavalier<br>3.国会=Parliament=The Roundheads (圆头是国会，议员都滑头)</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>1648-1649<br>查理二世</td>
                <td>英国内战Civil War第二次</td>
                <td>著名战役：<br>1644The Battle of Marston Moor马斯顿荒原战役<br>1645年The Battle of Naseby纳西比战役</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>1649-1651<br>查理二世</td>
                <td>英国内战Civil War第三次</td>
                <td>1.查理一世被处死1649年；defeated by Oliver Cromwell 被克伦威尔<br>打败；<br>3. 查理二世流亡荷兰，躲到一个oak树下面<br>4.克伦威尔死了1658年，查理二世又回来复辟即位。<br>（一世老爸处死，二世儿子流亡）</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>1815</td>
                <td>滑铁卢之战Battle of Waterloo</td>
                <td>英国和法国最后一战斗；也是拿破仑一世的最后一战</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>1853 to 1856</td>
                <td>克里米亚战争Crimean War —<br>英国/Russia打</td>
                <td>是第一场被媒体通过新闻报道和照片广泛报道的战争。</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>1899 to 1902</td>
                <td>波尔战争The Boer War</td>
                <td><span class="bold-text">South Africa with settlers from the Netherlands called the<br>Boers.</span> (荷兰移民-南非-波尔战争)</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td><span class="red-text">1914-1918</span></td>
                <td>一战 11.11.11结束</td>
                <td>1.一战爆发原因:1914奥地利Archduke Franz Ferdinand of Austri被<br>刺杀<br>2.一战后女性贡献，开始有投票权30岁</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>1939 —1945</td>
                <td>二战</td>
                <td>AIR WWII德国入侵波兰是二战开始 <span class="red-text">1939会考</span></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td></td>
                <td>敦刻尔克大撤退Dunkirk spirit 精神</td>
                <td>是第二次世界大战初期的英法联军的军事撤退行动</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>1940</td>
                <td>不列颠之战Battle of Britain<br>英/德空军之战</td>
                <td>aerial battle between Germany and Britain in the summer<br>（空军-英国和德国-二战）</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td></td>
                <td>The Battle of Trafalgar</td>
                <td>Admiral Nelson</td>
            </tr>
        </table>

        <div class="watermark">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path d="M12 21.35l-1.45-1.32C5.4 15.36 2 12.28 2 8.5 2 5.42 4.42 3 7.5 3c1.74 0 3.41.81 4.5 2.09C13.09 3.81 14.76 3 16.5 3 19.58 3 22 5.42 22 8.5c0 3.78-3.4 6.86-8.55 11.54L12 21.35z"/>
            </svg>
            <div class="watermark-text">
                <div class="title">@家务温书</div>
                <div class="subtitle">From 小红书</div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

</body>
</html>
```
